TEXT 1104 224 Left 2 ;Electrode 1 (stim)
TEXT 1104 960 Left 2 ;Electrode 2 (return) + neck tissue model
TEXT 288 96 Left 2 ;Improved Howland current pump (NE5532 half A): Iout = Vin*(1/Rsense + 1/Rset). R2 is trimmed to balance on the bench.
TEXT 64 1008 Left 2 ;--- Tunable stimulation parameters ---
TEXT 64 1040 Left 2 !.param Iamp=2m Freq=25 PW=250u IPG=50u
TEXT 64 1072 Left 2 !.param Vrail=9 Rsense=100 Rset=150k
TEXT 64 1104 Left 2 !.param Vset={Iamp/(1/Rsense+1/Rset)}
TEXT 64 1136 Left 2 !.param Rskin=10k Cskin=470n Rtis=500
TEXT 64 1168 Left 2 !.tran 0 {1m+5/Freq} 0 1u
TEXT 64 1200 Left 2 !.step param Iamp list 2m 4m 10m 14m
TEXT 800 1040 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Ipos MAX I(Rbody)
TEXT 800 1072 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Ineg MIN I(Rbody)
TEXT 800 1104 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vmax MAX V(drv)
TEXT 800 1136 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vmin MIN V(drv)
TEXT 800 1168 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Qnet INTEG I(Rbody)
TEXT 528 576 Left 2 ;DC servo (NE5532 half B): holds the average of V(drv) at 0 V. D1/D2 clamp its inputs so it cannot latch at a rail.
TEXT 64 1232 Left 2 !.step param Vrail list 9 18
TEXT 64 1264 Left 2 ;Vin = GPIO25 - GPIO26 on the bench. Firmware gain calibrated with "gain 29000".
TEXT 800 1200 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Voutmax MAX V(out)
TEXT 800 1232 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Voutmin MIN V(out)
TEXT 800 1264 Left 2 !.meas TRAN I1end FIND I(Rbody) AT={1m+PW-5u}
TEXT 800 1296 Left 2 !.meas TRAN Vservo FIND V(vs) AT=1m
